flowchart LR
  Start["start goal"] --> Run["run-specific state"]
  Run --> Verify["status verifies<br/>branch · HEAD · dirty files"]
  Verify --> Work["native agent works"]
  Work --> Checkpoint["checkpoint<br/>decisions · completed · remaining · blockers"]
  Checkpoint --> Validate["run configured checks<br/>save evidence logs"]
  Validate -->|RED| Work
  Validate -->|GREEN| Fresh{"Evidence still current?"}
  Fresh -->|commit / files / commands changed| Stale["STALE<br/>completion rejected"]
  Stale --> Validate
  Fresh -->|yes| Finish{"Next action"}
  Finish -->|another agent| Handoff["handoff<br/>release lease"]
  Handoff --> Verify
  Finish -->|done| Complete["complete"]
